  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"> \n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3aa06c5056e6b7f40e5cc3af34426c7581b8105c.png\">\n<h4>小巧精致的扩展，旨在与机械动力（Create）深度集成。</h4>\n\n<hr>\n<div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-bits-n-bobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"可在Modrinth获取\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-bits-n-bobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"可在CurseForge获取\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Industrialists-Of-Create/Create-Bits-n-Bobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"可在GitHub获取\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\"></a>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"支持NeoForge\" src=\"https://github.com/VladisCrafter/Create-IDLX/raw/main/README-images/neoforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"不支持Fabric\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/unsupported/fabric_vector.svg\"></a>\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/主要版本-1.21.1-orange.svg?style=for-the-badge\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持版本-1.21.1/1.20.1-orange.svg?style=for-the-badge\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/许可证-MIT-blue.svg?style=for-the-badge\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.oreostack.uk%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/翻译-CROWDIN-gold.svg?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n\n</div><p></p><hr><span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SmQ71MCeq2w\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><p></p><hr><h2>特性列表</h2><ul>\n<li>基于齿轮的链条传动（在机械动力的齿轮或法兰齿轮上使用链条）</li>\n<li>辉光管变体（辉光板 &amp; 大型辉光管）</li>\n<li>椅子</li>\n<li>方块内嵌头灯</li>\n<li>支架构件</li>\n<li>平面世界预设（关注型）</li>\n<li>风化支架</li>\n<li>链条滑轮变体</li>\n<li>瓦岩石材调色板</li>\n<li>灯泡 &amp; 黄铜灯</li>\n</ul><h2>所有特性均可配置！</h2><p>你可以通过配置文件禁用单个特性，随心定制模组。配置文件还允许你调整某些模组数值的平衡。</p><h2>可用翻译&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.oreostack.uk%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往Crowdin贡献翻译！</a></h2><ul>\n<li>简体中文</li>\n<li>葡萄牙语（葡萄牙）</li>\n<li>葡萄牙语（巴西）</li>\n<li>俄语</li>\n<li>西班牙语</li>\n<li>土耳其语</li>\n<li>乌克兰语</li>\n<li>西班牙语（墨西哥）</li>\n<li>海盗英语（海盗用语）</li>\n</ul><h3>机器翻译</h3><p>部分常用语言已通过机器翻译内置游戏内文本，但尚待人工审校。我们非常欢迎你的贡献：</p><ul>\n<li>波兰语</li>\n<li>法语</li>\n<li>法语（加拿大）</li>\n<li>瑞典语</li>\n<li>荷兰语</li>\n</ul><h2>荣耀归于AZ科技</h2><p><strong><em>由Cake、Kipti、Astral和NormalGuy创作，感谢mr mellz在链条传动算法方面的帮助</em></strong></p>",
